               US NEWS & DUNGEON REPORT
 23-APR-80                                    Late Dungeon Edition
 This is a first, trial version of Dungeon on the B7700 based upon
 the DEC FORTRAN version.  Major differences between this version and
 the version currently available on the ARPAnet include:

      -Lack of an endgame.
      -Simple parser (no compound sentences).
      -Numerous bugs and spelling errors.

 This version of Dungeon includes a patch such that break-on-output
 will no longer cause the program to be DSed.
